sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant K as StumpWM's keys<br/>(*top-map*)
  participant C as vikix-focus<br/>(viri.lisp)
  participant G as the strip<br/>(a viri-group)
  participant X as the X server
  You->>K: Super+l
  K->>C: the command vikix-focus right
  C->>G: viri-step: the column on the right,<br/>the window focused there last
  G->>G: group-focus-window, then viri-scroll-to
  Note over G: the offset changes only as far as<br/>the column needs to be whole on the screen
  G->>X: viri-slide: every column moved a little,<br/>eight times in about 0.12 s
  G->>X: viri-place: each window's final place and size,<br/>its title bar across its top
  G->>X: viri-keep-pointer: the pointer goes to the focused window,<br/>and what X said of the moves is dropped
  X-->>You: the strip has slid, the next column has the focus
